SUMMARY:Dream Retirement: Social Security Strategy Evening in Tomball
DTSTAMP:20260801T054344Z
DTSTART:20260804T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Be Retirement Prepared presents the free\, educational Dream Re
	tirement: Social Security Strategy Evening at Hyatt Place Houston NW Vinta
	ge Park in Tomball. \nThe evening will cover Social Security’s current rul
	es\, the recent SECURE 2.0 changes\, and the filing and timing strategies 
	that could help you make the most of the benefits you have earned. \nSocia
	l Security is one of the biggest financial decisions of retirement\, and o
	ne of the few you usually cannot undo. \nHighlights\n\nCurrent Social Secu
	rity rules and recent SECURE 2.0 changes\nTradeoffs of claiming early vers
	us later\, and how to weigh the timing\nHow spousal and survivor benefits 
	work for married couples\nFiling strategies that could help you make the m
	ost of your benefits\n\nThere will be no pressure and nothing is sold\, ju
	st clear guidance and a chance to get your questions answered. Seating is 
	limited\, so reservations are recommended. \nDoors open at 6:45pm. \nAdmis
	sion\nFree with RSVP. RSVP or learn more. \n  \n  \n  \nThis Featured Cale
	ndar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calen
	dar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\
	, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps
	://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-social-security-strate
	gy-evening-in-tomball/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-social-securit
	y-strategy-evening-in-tomball/
LOCATION:Hyatt Place Houston NW Vintage Park\, 20330 Tomball Pkwy\, Houston
	\, 77070\, United States
