UID:jw2U6eF4MIh1H9gwdQdgn
SUMMARY:Big3 at Toyota Center
DTSTAMP:20260801T054344Z
DTSTART:20260806T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Big3\, a professional 3-on-3 half-court 
	basketball league co-founded by Ice Cube\, to the Downtown arena’s court f
	or 2 games on Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 and Thursday\, August 6\, 2026. \nJu
	st one ticket gets admission to both games\, which combine basketball\, en
	tertainment\, and family fun and \nBig3 Game Schedule\n\nDMV Trilogy vs. M
	iami 305 | Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 at 11:30am\nHouston Rig Hands vs. Dalla
	s Power | Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 at 7pm\n\nAdmission\nTickets are $45 
	and a single ticket admits you to both games. Get tickets or learn more. \
	n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer an
	d boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about
	 promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of o
	ur channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/big3-at-toyota-ce
	nter-2/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/big3-at-toyota-center-2/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
UID:7qks0n-ukqJ82XOSJvTft
SUMMARY:The Girl on the Train at Alley Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260801T054344Z
DTSTART:20260806T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Alley Theatre presents The Girl on the Train\, the 2026 product
	ion in Alley’s annual Summer Chills series\, live on stage in Downtown. \n
	The modern psychological thriller\, adapted from the best-selling novel an
	d hit film\, follows Rachel\, a woman struggling with dependency. \nShe mu
	st piece together her fragmented memories to find a girl who’s gone missin
	g. As her night comes back to her\, she considers\, “Who can you trust whe
	n you can’t trust yourself?” \nAdmission\nTickets start at $32. Order tick
	ets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by th
	e event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details
	. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or o
	ffer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calend
	ar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-theatre-15/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in 
	Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-
	theatre-15/
LOCATION:Alley Theatre\, 615 Texas St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
