IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
UID:pkZNjPaWckwrYa3Zej5Bd
SUMMARY:Pokemon Mini Con
DTSTAMP:20260801T054344Z
DTSTART:20260822T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon Mini Con – Pick Your Starter\, Start Your Adventure\nAs
	k ten Pokémon fans how they got started and you’ll hear ten different answ
	ers. It might have been opening a Game Boy for the first time. Or racing h
	ome to watch the anime after school. Maybe it was pulling a favorite card 
	from a pack and carrying it everywhere for months. Pokémon Mini Con is all
	 about those moments! \n  \n📅 August 22\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bisson
	net St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 E
	vent Highlights 🔥\n🛍️ Pokémon Marketplace\nThe marketplace floor at Pokémon
	 Mini Con feels a lot like stepping into the tall grass on Route 1. Every 
	booth brings a new encounter\, with cards to chase\, collectibles to disco
	ver\, and hidden gems waiting to be found. You never know when you’ll run 
	into the piece that completes your collection or the find you didn’t know 
	you needed. \n  \n🦹‍♂️ Pokémon Cosplay Showcase\nSuit up\, Trainers! Transfor
	m into your favorite Pokémon characters or Gym Leaders and show off your m
	oves in our cosplay showcase. \n  \n⚡ Be a Vendor\nNew encounter unlocked:
	 Pokémon Mini Con vendor applications are open! If you specialize in cards
	\, collectibles\, artwork\, or all things Pokémon\, we want you to be part
	 of the adventure. → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🌊
	 Calling all Pokémon Fans\nEvery great Trainer needs the right team. We’re
	 looking for collaborators ready to join the journey to the Elite Four. \n
	🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8 \n🎤 Workshops & Pan
	els → https://forms.gle/cdpspG6VpUtpaNZ7A \n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://
	forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \nHave a love for Pokémon and want to be part 
	of the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 
	📩 \n  \nFrom your first starter Pokémon to your latest collection addition
	\, Pokémon Mini Con celebrates every step of the Trainer journey. 🧢\n\nhtt
	ps://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
